{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style>\r\n\t.titleBox {\r\n\t\tmax-width: 720px;margin: 0 auto;padding: 0 12px;color: #333; font-family: 'Heebo', 'Pretendard', sans-serif;box-sizing: border-box;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.sectionTitleH2 {\r\n\t\tmargin: 18px 0 8px;font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 5.2rem;font-weight: 600;letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #222;line-height: 1.15;word-break: keep-all;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.font-28 {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 20px;font-weight: 800;color: #222;margin: 0 0 18px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.block {\r\n\t\tmax-width: 645px;padding: 20px 0;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option {\r\n\t\tmargin-top: 18px;border-top: 1px solid #666;border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option h6,\r\n\t.textBox h6 {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 16px;font-weight: 700;margin: 0 0 14px;color: #222;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option dl {\r\n\t\tdisplay: flex;align-items: flex-start;gap: 10px; margin: 0;padding: 12px 0;border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;font-size: 15px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option dl:first-of-type {\r\n\t\tborder-top: 0;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option dt {\r\n\t\twidth: 140px;flex-shrink: 0;display: flex;align-items: center; font-weight: 700;color: #222;line-height: 1.4;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option dd {\r\n\t\tmargin: 0;flex: 1;font-weight: 400;color: #555;line-height: 1.5; word-break: keep-all;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option i {\r\n\t\tfont-family: xeicon !important;font-size: 16px;margin-right: 6px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.textBox {\r\n\t\tmargin-top: 18px;color: #333;line-height: 1.65;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.textBox p {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 15px;margin: 0 0 16px;color: #555;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t@media (max-width:1024px) {\r\n\t\t.sectionTitleH2 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 4.2rem;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.font-28 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 18px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.block {\r\n\t\t\tmax-width: 100%;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t@media (max-width:600px) {\r\n\t\t.titleBox {\r\n\t\t\tpadding: 0 14px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.sectionTitleH2 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 2.8rem;line-height: 1.1;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.font-28 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 16px;margin-bottom: 14px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.option dl {\r\n\t\t\tflex-direction: column;gap: 6px;padding: 12px 0;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.option dt {\r\n\t\t\twidth: auto;font-size: 14px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.option dd {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 14px;padding-left: 22px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.option i {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 15px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.option h6,\r\n\t\t.textBox h6 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 15px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.textBox p {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 14px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n</style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"titleBox\"><h2 class=\"sectionTitleH2\">수용성 실란트</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"font-28\">일반 실리콘과 다르게 경화 후 페인트 작업이 가능</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"option block\">\r\n\r\n<h6>상품 사양</h6>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt><i class=\"xi-check-circle-o\"></i>제조</dt>\r\n<dd>(주)오공(대한민국)</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt><i class=\"xi-check-circle-o\"></i>용도</dt>\r\n<dd>벽지, 지물, 인테리어</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt><i class=\"xi-check-circle-o\"></i>용량</dt>\r\n<dd>300ml</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"textBox block\">\r\n\r\n<h6>상품 설명</h6>\r\n\r\n<p>건축물 내부 벽면에 크랙 충진 시, 강력접착이 필요한 벽지 테두리 접착 등 지물의 특정 부위를 완전하게 시공할 수 있습니다. 아크릴 실란트는 실리콘 실란트와 달리 충진 경화 후 페인트 작업이 가능하여 각종 보수작업에도 널리 사용됩니다.</p>\r\n\r\n<h6>용도</h6>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n콘크리트, 석재, 스레트, 회벽등의 다공성자재 보수\r\n<br />건축물의 내부 석고보드 조인트실링\r\n<br />벽면의 크랙부위 보수\r\n<br />움직임이 적은 조립부분의 실링\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h6>특징</h6>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n1액형으로 사용이 간편합니다.\r\n<br />친환경 수용성 제품으로 독성이 없습니다.\r\n<br />실링작업 후 도장이 가능합니다.\r\n<br />일시적으로 습한곳에 시공이 가능합니다.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}